    "number": 96,
    "summary": "1, The Kirtland Stake of Zion is to be made strong; 2–5, The bishop is to divide the inheritances for the Saints; 6–9, John Johnson is to be a member of the united order.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given to Joseph Smith the Prophet, June 4, 1833. The occasion was a conference of high priests, and the chief subject of consideration was the disposal of certain lands, known as the French farm, possessed by the Church near Kirtland. Since the conference could not agree who should take charge of the farm, all agreed to inquire of the Lord concerning the matter."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
