        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 96,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And again, verily I say unto you, it is wisdom and expedient in me, that my servant John Johnson whose offering I have accepted, and whose prayers I have heard, unto whom I give a promise of eternal life inasmuch as he keepeth my commandments from henceforth—",
        "footNotes": [
